{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> for which the roots of \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/c/00c4e0023c5e84f2bf402be594a0dfb21c443160.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-px+p=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />\nare equal. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/82532bec9d09eaa4d41cbb914f30ccb0fa2c40f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{a finite number greater than 2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\infty$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"568\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/495a9a4cebd3995a8dacb23175c6349d5a53e384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - px + p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> has discriminant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/e/90efa3aa3c3fab45f4eae0f1ab49aee5d0c064e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p^2 - 4p = p(p-4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"21\" />.  For the roots of this quadratic to be equal, the discriminant must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which only happens if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/8/868c0cce47ca5e001d017eaf95b3a9b31c7b292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/e/6be241415c542a527773b9c883ce3cba4c07f1d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />.  Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adefec827068fcce8470f84eb8444d1848f285a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> such values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a 